:: Bedroom
<<set $location to "Bedroom">>
!你的卧室

<<sceneimg "Bedroom">>

<<hubscene "Bedroom" "calm" "不大但整洁的卧室，靠墙一张床，书桌上散落着笔记，阳光透过窗帘">>

你也可以：

<<action "睡一会儿" "SleepAction" "恢复体力，推进时间">>
<<action "学习或工作" "StudyAction" "降低压力，消耗体力">>
<<action "去街上" "Street" "离开公寓">>
<<action "打开设置" "Settings" "保存、读取或配置">>

:: SleepAction
<<if $player.stamina gte 90>>
  你还不困，躺在床上翻来覆去。

  <<action "返回" "Bedroom">>
<<else>>
  <<set $player.stamina to Math.min($player.maxStamina, $player.stamina + 40)>>
  <<set $player.stress to Math.max(0, $player.stress - 10)>>
  <<set $player.hunger to Math.min(100, $player.hunger + 10)>>
  <<run addSkillXP("意志", 3)>>
  <<run advanceTime(4, 0)>>
  <<run completeTutorialObjective(0)>>
  <<run showFeedback(["体力 +40", "压力 -10", "饥饿 +10", "时间推进 4小时0分"])>>

  你睡了几个小时。休息让你感觉好多了，但肚子有点饿。

  <<action "醒来" "Bedroom">>
<</if>>

:: StudyAction
<<if $player.stress gt 70>>
  你压力太大，无法集中注意力。

  <<action "返回" "Bedroom">>
<<elseif $player.stamina lt 25>>
  你太累了，无法学习。

  <<action "返回" "Bedroom">>
<<else>>
  <<set _diffMod to getDifficultyModifier()>>
  <<set _feedbackMsgs to ["体力 -20", "压力 -5", "自控 +2"]>>
  <<set $player.stamina to Math.max(0, $player.stamina - 20)>>
  <<set $player.stress to Math.max(0, $player.stress - 5)>>
  <<set $player.control to Math.min(100, $player.control + 2)>>
  <<set _studyReward to random(1, 10)>>
  <<if _studyReward * _diffMod.moneyGain gte 8>>
    <<set _studyMoney to Math.max(1, Math.round(5 * _diffMod.moneyGain))>>
    <<set $player.money += _studyMoney>>
    <<set $player.reputation += 1>>
    <<run _feedbackMsgs.push("金钱 +" + _studyMoney)>>
    <<run _feedbackMsgs.push("声望 +1")>>
    你完成了一份在线兼职，赚了 $<<print _studyMoney>>，声望 +1。
  <</if>>
  <<run addSkillXP("学识", 8)>>
  <<run advanceTime(2, 0)>>
  <<set $player.dailyActions += 1>>
  <<run showFeedback(_feedbackMsgs)>>

  你花了一些时间学习。虽然疲惫，但很有成就感。

  <<action "继续" "Bedroom">>
<</if>>

:: Street
<<set $location to "Street">>
<<run completeTutorialObjective(1)>>
!城市街道

<<sceneimg "Street">>

<<if $time.hour gte 22 or $time.hour lt 6>>
  <<hubscene "Street" "dangerous" "深夜的街道，阴影中传来可疑的声响，醉汉在巷口徘徊">>
<<elseif $time.hour gte 18>>
  <<hubscene "Street" "lively" "傍晚的街道，霓虹灯刚刚亮起，人群熙熙攘攘">>
<<else>>
  <<hubscene "Street" "neutral" "车水马龙的城市街道，霓虹灯闪烁，远处飘来街头小吃的香味">>
<</if>>

你也可以：

<<action "去公园" "Park" "一个更安静的地方">>
<<action "去商店" "Shop" "购买补给">>
<<action "回家" "Bedroom" "回到公寓">>

:: Park
<<set $location to "Park">>
!中央公园

<<sceneimg "Park">>

<<if $time.hour gte 22 or $time.hour lt 6>>
  <<hubscene "Park" "eerie" "夜晚的公园，喷泉停止涌动，树影在风中摇曳，偶尔有夜行动物穿过灌木">>
<<elseif $time.hour gte 18>>
  <<hubscene "Park" "romantic" "黄昏的公园，路灯一盏盏亮起，情侣和慢跑者共享渐暗的天光">>
<<else>>
  <<hubscene "Park" "peaceful" "树木沿小径排列，长椅上坐着几个人，公园中央的喷泉汩汩作响">>
<</if>>

你也可以：

<<action "在长椅上休息" "RestAction" "恢复体力">>
<<action "慢跑" "JogAction" "增强体力，消耗能量">>
<<action "返回街道" "Street">>

:: RestAction
<<set $player.stamina to Math.min($player.maxStamina, $player.stamina + 25)>>
<<set $player.stress to Math.max(0, $player.stress - 15)>>
<<set $player.hunger to Math.min(100, $player.hunger + 5)>>
<<run addSkillXP("意志", 2)>>
<<run advanceTime(1, 0)>>
<<set $player.dailyActions += 1>>
<<run showFeedback(["体力 +25", "压力 -15", "饥饿 +5", "时间推进 1小时0分"])>>

你在长椅上休息，看着人来人往。

<<action "站起来" "Park">>

:: JogAction
<<if $player.stamina lt 30>>
  <<set $player.health to Math.max(0, $player.health - 5)>>
  <<set $player.trauma to Math.min(100, $player.trauma + 3)>>
  <<run addSkillXP("运动", 2)>>
  <<run showFeedback(["健康 -5", "创伤 +3", "饥饿 +8", "时间推进 1小时30分"])>>
  你太累了，跑步时扭伤了脚踝。健康 -5，创伤 +3。
<<else>>
  <<set $player.stamina to Math.min($player.maxStamina, $player.stamina + 5)>>
  <<set $player.health to Math.min($player.maxHealth, $player.health + 3)>>
  <<set $player.stress to Math.max(0, $player.stress - 5)>>
  <<set $player.allure to Math.min(100, $player.allure + 1)>>
  <<run addSkillXP("运动", 10)>>
  <<run showFeedback(["体力 +5", "健康 +3", "压力 -5", "魅力 +1", "饥饿 +8", "时间推进 1小时30分"])>>
  你绕着公园慢跑。肌肉在燃烧，但你感到更强壮了。
<</if>>
<<set $player.hunger to Math.min(100, $player.hunger + 8)>>
<<run advanceTime(1, 30)>>
<<set $player.dailyActions += 1>>

<<action "喘口气" "Park">>

:: Shop
<<set $location to "Shop">>
!街角小店

<<sceneimg "Shop">>

<<if $time.hour gte 22 or $time.hour lt 6>>
  <<hubscene "Shop" "closed" "小店已经拉下铁门，橱窗里只剩一盏昏暗的灯">>
<<elseif $time.hour gte 18>>
  <<hubscene "Shop" "busy" "下班高峰，店员忙着结账，货架被挑得有些凌乱">>
<<else>>
  <<hubscene "Shop" "mundane" "货架上摆满零食、饮料和基础用品，店员在柜台后点头致意">>
<</if>>

你也可以：

<<action "买食物（$5）" "BuyFoodAction" "恢复健康和体力">>
<<action "浏览商品" "BrowseAction" "四处看看">>
<<action "离开" "Street">>

:: BuyFoodAction
<<if $player.money gte 5>>
  <<set $player.money -= 5>>
  <<set $player.health to Math.min($player.maxHealth, $player.health + 15)>>
  <<set $player.stamina to Math.min($player.maxStamina, $player.stamina + 20)>>
  <<run addSkillXP("社交", 4)>>
  <<set $player.hunger to Math.max(0, $player.hunger - 30)>>
  <<run addToInventory("零食", 1)>>
  <<run completeTutorialObjective(2)>>
  <<run showFeedback(["健康 +15", "体力 +20", "饥饿 -30", "金钱 -5", "获得零食 x1"])>>
  你买了一份快餐，吃了起来。饥饿感减轻了。
<<else>>
  <<run showFeedback(["金钱不足"])>>
  你的钱不够。
<</if>>

<<action "继续购物" "Shop">>

:: BrowseAction
你扫视着货架。今天没有什么特别吸引你的东西。

<<action "离开" "Shop">>

:: Inventory
!背包

你身上带着：

<<print formatInventory()>>

<<action "返回" "Start">>

:: About
!关于

这是一个受 *Degrees of Lewdity* 启发的 Twine + SugarCube-2 UI 原型。

它展示了：
- 场景导航
- 侧边栏状态栏
- 保存/读取系统
- 设置开关
- Mod 扩展接口
- 动态主题切换
- 像素艺术占位图生成

所有内容均为占位内容。

<<action "返回" "Start">>

:: DayReset
!新的一天

阳光（或雨声）提醒你，第 <<print $time.day>> 天开始了。

天气 <<print $world.weather>>，温度 <<print $world.temperature>>°C。

你感觉饥饿又找上门来。

<<action "起床" "Bedroom">>

:: GameOver
!游戏结束

<<if $game.overReason neq "">>
  <<print $game.overReason>>
<<else>>
  你无法再继续下去了。
<</if>>

这座城市还在运转，但你的故事暂时画上了句号。

<<link "重新开始">>
  <<set $player = {
    name: "Player",
    health: 100,
    maxHealth: 100,
    stamina: 80,
    maxStamina: 80,
    stress: 10,
    trauma: 0,
    money: 25,
    arousal: 0,
    control: 100,
    allure: 15,
    hunger: 0,
    reputation: 0,
    dailyActions: 0,
    maxDailyActions: 8,
    inventory: []
  }>>
  <<set $time = { hour: 8, minute: 0, day: 1, dayName: "Monday" }>>
  <<set $world = { weather: "clear", temperature: 22 }>>
  <<set $location to "Bedroom">>
  <<set $quests = {} >>
  <<set $activeQuestId to "" >>
  <<set $npcs = {} >>
  <<set $activeNPCId to "" >>
  <<set $worldMemory = { events: [] } >>
  <<set $llmHistory = [] >>
  <<set $llmSession = { active: false, sceneContext: "", lastResponse: "" } >>
  <<set $generatedScenes = {} >>
  <<set $dynamicSceneId to "" >>
  <<set $game.started to true >>
  <<set $game.tutorialComplete to false >>
  <<set $game.over to false >>
  <<set $game.overReason to "" >>
  <<set $game.rentPaid to false >>
  <<set $game.evicted to false >>
  <<set $game.rentDueDay to 7 >>
  <<goto "Start">>
<</link>>
